// # Protein Folding & Molecular Dynamics Unified Facade
//
// Logline: Unified facade re-exporting MD integrators, force fields, electrostatics, coarse-grained models, AlphaFold neural modules, and structural metrics.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and facade importing all 49 protein folding companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular Protein Folding & Molecular Dynamics subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, energy engines, neural attention layers, and structural scoring entry points.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility with downstream openOODA callers.

